      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The present paper deals with clinico-pathological analysis of 22 cases of hair follicle neoplasm, representing 23.4% of skin appendage tumours. The mean age was 32 years, M : F ratio was 1:1. Histopathologically, there were 15 cases of pilomatrixoma, 5 cases of trichoepithelioma and 2 cases of trichelemmoma."},
